#! rnews 588
Path: mirror.oldnet.example!summer98.example!not-for-mail
From: skylark <skylark@summer98.example>
Newsgroups: alt.games.homebrew
Subject: Last Light - a small game about a lighthouse (artist wanted)
Date: Sat, 18 Apr 1998 22:14:05 -0700
Message-ID: <ll-0001.skylark@summer98.example>
Organization: a bedroom with a 486 in it
Lines: 7

I'm making a little game about a seaside town. There is a lighthouse
keeper called Theo. Every night he checks the light. The light does not
work yet. Neither does most of the game.

I can code. I cannot draw a seagull to save my life. Anyone?

-- sky
