#! rnews 1060
Path: mirror.oldnet.example!summer98.example!not-for-mail
From: skylark <skylark@summer98.example>
Newsgroups: alt.games.homebrew
Subject: Last Light 0.9 - summer build (manifest)
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 1998 21:05:00 -0700
Message-ID: <ll-0815.skylark@summer98.example>
References: <ll-0001.skylark@summer98.example>
Lines: 25

summer build! the pier works, the bridge holds (thank you june),
and the lighthouse is still half a lighthouse. june is writing the
lamp rule. the build will pick it up when she posts it.

LLMANIFEST 1
build 1998
title Last Light 0.9 (summer build)
credit skylark code
credit junebug town art story
asset town inline
asset plaza inline
asset bakery_sign_1998 inline
asset mural_1998 inline
asset notice_1998 inline
asset bunting inline
asset gulls inline
asset bridge attach <junebug.19980814.2@inkwell.example> bridge.ll 725 118ca1f9
asset seawall_gap inline
asset pier_old inline
asset point_rocks inline
asset lighthouse_scaffold inline
asset lighthouse_rule wanted <lighthouse-rule.1998@inkwell.example> trigger=pier_end
end

-- sky
#! rnews 809
Path: mirror.oldnet.example!oldnet.example!not-for-mail
From: skylark <evance@oldnet.example>
Newsgroups: alt.games.homebrew
Subject: Last Light 1.0 (public build)
Date: Wed, 03 Mar 2004 01:12:40 +0000
Message-ID: <lastlight-1.0.evance@oldnet.example>
References: <ll-0815.skylark@summer98.example>
Lines: 18

Tidied up the old summer build and put it somewhere it will not disappear.
The pier is closed. The lighthouse is finished.

LLMANIFEST 1
build 2004
title Last Light 1.0 (public build)
credit skylark
asset town inline
asset plaza inline
asset bakery_sign_2004 inline
asset mural_2004 inline
asset notice_2004 inline
asset bridge attach <junebug.19980814.2@inkwell.example> bridge.ll 725 118ca1f9
asset seawall inline
asset pier_closed inline
asset point_path inline
asset lighthouse_tower inline
end
